From 66dc1ff505a39ee5aa907431a4e99bc5143cece3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matt Liberty <mliberty@precisioninno.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 16:01:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/13] python: make every tool module re-export openroadpy

openroadpy now re-exports odb, utl and rmp, which stay separate extensions
because other extensions import them, so `from openroadpy import *` is the
whole API and every python/modules file is that one line. wmk adds an
alias: in the shared namespace CtsOptions is the cts class, and the
watermark options are WatermarkCtsOptions.

gpl's classes were built twice, in openroadpy and in a separate _gpl.so,
giving two PlaceOptions and Replace classes. Drop the separate extension
(25 MB of the wheel), and drop src/wmk/wmk.py, which python/modules/wmk.py
replaces.

Signed-off-by: Matt Liberty <mliberty@precisioninno.com>
